    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br>Started with nothing but an empty lot, a crusty dough recipe, and an unhealthy obsession with domination through pizza.  <br>Now? I run an empire.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713690/extras/06b9689e456531b8af028f02e6475e9e.poster.avif?t=1747194577\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713690/extras/06b9689e456531b8af028f02e6475e9e.webm?t=1747194577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713690/extras/06b9689e456531b8af028f02e6475e9e.mp4?t=1747194577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br>In <i>Idle Pizza Business</i>, I built everything from the ground up\u2014one greasy machine, one overworked staff member, one impatient customer at a time. Every slice that goes out the door lines my pockets, whether I\u2019m there or not. That\u2019s the power of automation, baby.     <br>     <br>I built the machines.     <br>I trained the staff.     <br>I crushed the competition.     <br>     <br>The Skills Department sharpened my edge\u2014faster moves, bigger hauls, fatter profits. HR kept the drones in line, upgraded and pushing their limits. I added drive-thru service to keep the dough rolling, packaging stations to move product faster, dining tables to handle the rush.     <br>     <br>Three locations.     <br>Endless upgrades.      <br>No sleep. Just pizza.      <br>     <br><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Offline Income</strong> \u2013 The money never stops. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713690/extras/50acf3cf135e0298989776665c3431c9.avif?t=1747194577\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pizza Machines &amp; Packaging Stations</strong> \u2013 Industrialize your operation. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713690/extras/c6876fd4b0c2da7529b64a5b2c348e3d.avif?t=1747194577\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skills Department</strong> \u2013 Speed. Capacity. Profit. You\u2019re not here to play nice. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713690/extras/ed62ec15fd0e3554f804fef726a82a57.avif?t=1747194577\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HR Department</strong> \u2013 Hire, train, and squeeze every ounce of value from your crew. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713690/extras/db3306df6d4c39c12730a87af87c156a.avif?t=1747194577\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drive-Thru Window</strong> \u2013 More mouths. More money. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713690/extras/b207358632745ae805c4ae2b5731812f.avif?t=1747194577\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dining Tables</strong> \u2013 Expand. Accommodate. Dominate. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713690/extras/398b84d1325dee6889406b203c6ec8b5.avif?t=1747194577\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Location Expansion</strong> \u2013 Three unique maps, one shared goal: total pizza control. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713690/extras/a18595ded2d20c1386508f6ac4f59b20.avif?t=1747194577\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades Galore</strong> \u2013 If it moves, cooks, or carries, it can be improved. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713690/extras/6823b56844e3c3d6d7395c83122eafff.avif?t=1747194577\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s not just pizza. It\u2019s power.<br>And I\u2019m not stopping \u2018til I own every damn pepperoni on the map.</p>",
