mg class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713690/extras/a18595ded2d20c1386508f6ac4f59b20.avif?t=1747194577\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades Galore</strong> \u2013 If it moves, cooks, or carries, it can be improved. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713690/extras/6823b56844e3c3d6d7395c83122eafff.avif?t=1747194577\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s not just pizza. It\u2019s power.<br>And I\u2019m not stopping \u2018til I own every damn pepperoni on the map.</p>",
